     "note": "A task's status comes from `tasks.jsonl` alone (TASK-262 Amendment (4), round 4b; the user's decision of 2026-09-15). Before 3.4 `lib.task_status_index` put the rows of a `BOARD.md` a project still held beneath the store, so a linked id that only the held file carried was counted by its file status. From 3.4 the file is retired and not read: such an id is counted from the event log's last state-moving event if it has one, and otherwise as `unknown`. On a project with no held board, and on one whose board rows are all in its store, every count is unchanged. No key was added, removed or retyped. A project whose tasks live only in a held board imports them first, by the task store's `--from-board` import (`reference/version-compatibility.md § Upgrading a project to G3`)."},
    {"version": "3.5",
     "fields": ["krs[].checks",
                "krs[].state",
